{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/4a9b93ad5ee0cadcc0b37c0122e40325.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1000 height=214 /></span><strong><i>PULP ACTION SHOTGUN</i></strong><i> </i>is a snarky round-based boomer shooter inspired by classics like <i>Quake, Doom and COD Zombies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SURVIVE</i></strong> the endless waves of demons hellbent on your demise. With nothing but your <u><strong><i>Ol' Reliable Shotgun</i></strong></u> you will face the oncoming apocalypse alone. The longer you survive the bigger the horde, the more bloodthirsty they will become. They will stop at nothing to defeat you, so make it a worthy battle to the death!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shotgun can be used for more than just killing, as the recoil is strong enough to send you flying. A well placed shot to the ground will open the skies for traversal, <strong><i>a beautiful way to escape danger.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.poster.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.webm?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.mp4?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Endless Round-Based Survival Combat</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Single Weapon Mastery </i></strong><i>(The Shotgun)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shotgun Recoil for Mobility</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Precious Resource Management</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hidden Secrets &amp; Upgrades</i></strong><i> (ssssh\u2026)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>3 Comic-Inspired Levels</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/b63c451f6d16f1a3f9f52b2c932114be.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE\u00a0</strong>the natural blending of pulp comics with the FPS world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The heart and soul of the genre coming from its loud, obnoxious and campy heritage.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the age of superheroes we had rugged men with nothing to lose. Here you can live the dream of the one man army that fights for the side of good, <strong>even when out matched.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/507822011b0f92969bb34e2c0aececb5.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EXPLORE</strong></i> each map, designed around an issue of a comic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With locations being used so often over the decades that you could name them off by heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Amazonian Jungle, The Decrypted Mansion and The Filthy Streets of a Noire City.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birthplace of these timeless backdrops come from the golden age of Pulp, and now you can walk <i>(or better yet kill)</i> in these classic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.poster.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.webm?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.mp4?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/8ae5cc9d9fc4d5bcfc865adb9c28b10c.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIMATE </strong>with the almighty PUMP ACTION SHOTGUN!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Why would you need anything other than a perfectly powerful shotgun?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pump action shotgun is the most iconic weapon in the genre. From mob bosses to cult heroes. A weapon whose blast echoes like a moving cannon and tears both flesh and paper to shreds. Sure other weapons have range, speed, form factor etc. But they can't match the feeling of a well placed shotgun blast to a demon's centre mass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The only thing better than a shotgun? TWO SHOTGUNS!!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.poster.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.webm?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.mp4?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451110?t=1772904827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/5ffad8981096139650fc4dcdef2832f2bcf9d6b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772904827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/ad9e088126dbd4f15690426219258ca21f8ac1c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772904827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/ad9e088126dbd4f15690426219258ca21f8ac1c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772904827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/4a9b93ad5ee0cadcc0b37c0122e40325.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1000 height=214 /></span><strong><i>PULP ACTION SHOTGUN</i></strong><i> </i>is a snarky round-based boomer shooter inspired by classics like <i>Quake, Doom and COD Zombies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SURVIVE</i></strong> the endless waves of demons hellbent on your demise. With nothing but your <u><strong><i>Ol' Reliable Shotgun</i></strong></u> you will face the oncoming apocalypse alone. The longer you survive the bigger the horde, the more bloodthirsty they will become. They will stop at nothing to defeat you, so make it a worthy battle to the death!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shotgun can be used for more than just killing, as the recoil is strong enough to send you flying. A well placed shot to the ground will open the skies for traversal, <strong><i>a beautiful way to escape danger.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.poster.avif?t=1772904827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.webm?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.mp4?t=1772904827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Endless Round-Based Survival Combat</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Single Weapon Mastery </i></strong><i>(The Shotgun)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shotgun Recoil for Mobility</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Precious Resource Management</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hidden Secrets &amp; Upgrades</i></strong><i> (ssssh\u2026)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>3 Comic-Inspired Levels</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati