1110/6168fe7f62c7b80a32e7efeeca66f55f961461de/ss_6168fe7f62c7b80a32e7efeeca66f55f961461de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772904827","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/6168fe7f62c7b80a32e7efeeca66f55f961461de/ss_6168fe7f62c7b80a32e7efeeca66f55f961461de.600x338.jpg?t=1772904827"}],"short_description":"SURVIVE OR DIE. Face the spawn of hell in PULP ACTION SHOTGUN, a round-based boomer shooter fought with nothing but your Ol\u2019 Reliable Shotgun. Use recoil to propel yourself through the skies as chaos closes in. The longer you last, the tougher the enemies grow.","steam_appid":3451110,"support_info":{"email":"tom@monitr.games","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Finnish, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}